# Phase 5 transcript (WIDTH-DISPUTED rounds 2-3): p5-transcript-diffwide in the
# cluster form -- a Hangul filler with a mark after it (U+FFA0 U+0301, ...),
# conjoining jamo with a filler (U+115F U+1160) and a filler with a
# skin-tone modifier (U+1160 U+1F3FD, U+FFA0 U+1F3FD), short and at the
# screen's margin. fx counts such a line one code point at a time; read
# first on both sides, then Ctrl-O over the change.
gateway p5-transcript-diffwide2-turns.json
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
work p5-transcript-diffwide2ws
keep
wait 4
type edit the file
wait 1
key Enter
wait 5
snap edited
key C-o
wait 2
snap full
key C-o
wait 1
snap closed
gwlog
